| steps | tau | actual error against semidiscrete | previous/current temporal error | actual error against continuous PDE |
| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| 10 | 0.0100000 | 2.984314e-04 | 0.000000 | 2.957330e-06 |
| 20 | 0.0050000 | 7.454854e-05 | 4.003182 | 2.209255e-04 |
| 40 | 0.0025000 | 1.863343e-05 | 4.000795 | 2.768406e-04 |
| 80 | 0.0012500 | 4.658127e-06 | 4.000199 | 2.908159e-04 |
| 160 | 0.0006250 | 1.164517e-06 | 4.000050 | 2.943096e-04 |

